Nostos.Backend/wwwroot
Nostos.Backend/Storage
# The image only needs the frontend build and the .NET publish. Nothing in the
# Dockerfile copies from these, so they stay out of the build context: the
# documentation tree and the committed visual baselines cost ~230 MB per build
# and nothing in them can change the result.
docs/
Nostos.Frontend/e2e/visual-evidence/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.nostos
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*secret*
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
